[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711833747","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-2711833747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":2711833747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ho0yT","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T21:05:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T21:05:50Z","body":"Looks to be stemming from [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/30bb49ec1ff3b3fc463074b8d28bc97d4db50b9f/main/main.cpp#L3466). Not sure what the best approach would be. It sounds like based on the define below:\n```\n#if defined(MODULE_MONO_ENABLED) && defined(TOOLS_ENABLED)\n\t// Hacky to have it here, but we don't have good facility yet to let modules\n\t// register command line options to call at the right time. This needs to happen\n\t// after init'ing the ScriptServer, but also after init'ing the ThemeDB,\n\t// for the C# docs generation in the bindings.\n```\nthat we need can't initialize the theme later than this point. However, we need to have assets imported before using a custom theme. I don't understand enough about the finite details here.\n@YuriSizov for visibility.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711833747/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2712194095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-2712194095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":2712194095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hqMwv","user":{"login":"YuriSizov","id":11782833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzgyODMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11782833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov","html_url":"https://github.com/YuriSizov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T01:06:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T01:06:18Z","body":"> I imagine this shouldn't happen, since the goal of the `--import` flag should be to ensure all assets are imported before they are used.\n\nWhile it's ugly, it's completely normal to get errors related to assets not being imported when you run the `--import` utility. The point of the utility is to load the project once, let everything get imported, and then exit. Before it can do the second step, it will load the project with errors. You can safely ignore them.\n\nSorry, but I cannot help you any further. I am no longer a project maintainer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2712194095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2712215805","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-2712215805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":2712215805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hqSD9","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T01:14:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T01:14:50Z","body":"I disagree that it's normal to get import errors while importing. If you do, it should be indicative of something faulty with the asset being imported. Currently we have a large project where we clean, import, then export without any errors. However a designer recently added a custom theme which is now the sole error thrown. \n\nOn our fork, I've set it to force the default theme when the `--import` flag is present. This works, but I'm not sure it's the correct fix.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2712215805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2713330148","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-2713330148","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":2713330148,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6huiHk","user":{"login":"YuriSizov","id":11782833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzgyODMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11782833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov","html_url":"https://github.com/YuriSizov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T09:30:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T09:30:04Z","body":"> I disagree\n\nHey again! I wasn't offering you an opinion. I was explaining that this is unfortunately normal for how the engine's initialization is currently designed. There are a few things that raise errors on the first launch, extensions is another example. You didn't run into it before using themes, but that's not something specific to them. \n\nIdeally this shouldn't happen, but the initialization logic needs a rework. This is a known problem and has been on the agenda for a few years at this point, and probably at some future point someone will tackle it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2713330148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2714896868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-2714896868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":2714896868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h0gnk","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T16:03:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T16:03:03Z","body":"Can you link the issues you're referring to? We're not seeing any other errors raised on the first launch. When we do, we raise the issues here and clean them up.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2714896868/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715385211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-2715385211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":2715385211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h2X17","user":{"login":"YuriSizov","id":11782833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzgyODMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11782833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov","html_url":"https://github.com/YuriSizov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuriSizov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T18:44:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T18:46:40Z","body":"> Can you link the issues you're referring to?\n\n@pewcworrell I'm not keeping tabs on which issues are reported to this repository, so I'm not aware, and it will take me as much time to find out as it would you. I'm just sharing my knowledge about the matter since you tagged me and I have experience solving issues in the engine's startup routine.\n\nI also have an active project that [throws all manner of import errors](https://github.com/YuriSizov/boscaceoil-blue/actions/runs/13765978741/job/38492423747) for a whole bunch of resources during the mandatory cold import step in the CI pipeline — the project theme, a GDExtension, standalone fonts and textures. So that tells me that as of Godot 4.3, at least, there hasn't been any major change in the area since the time I've worked on it.\n\nSo I'm offering what I know about the engine because you have invited me. But I'm of no help here otherwise since I cannot fix these problems anymore. As I've said before, actual project maintainers will be able to assist you further.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715385211/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718877254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-2718877254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":2718877254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iDsZG","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/