riptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T23:47:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T23:47:14Z","body":"Just circling back to this for an update. I'm still not sure how to proceed since the discussion [here](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/asset-pipeline?msg=LCZaZSubWyRE2mRMo) trailed off. I also haven't had a need since my work around is sufficient for our custom version of the engine. If somebody else could give further direction and/or take ownership of this issue, that would be ideal.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978491205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366500436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-3366500436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":3366500436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IqLhU","user":{"login":"lucasteles","id":3037609,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzc2MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3037609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasteles","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasteles","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasteles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasteles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasteles/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasteles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.