type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T20:03:10Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T20:04:22Z","body":"I'm not certain, but this smells related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98806\nGiven that both are for texture assets loaded via project settings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583029825/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3616673813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103930#issuecomment-3616673813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930","id":3616673813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XkhAV","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-05T12:21:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T01:20:16Z","body":"This appears to be due to the lack of a default loader for loading files with the `.fontdata` extension as `FontFile`. Font importers save the data as files with the extension `.fontdata`.\n\nFor each `save_extension` of a `ResourceImporter`, a corresponding default loader should be provided.\n\nEdit:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/dec5a373d97cbadce5e1fabe6095ae9957ff3aa6/scene/resources/font.h#L185\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/dec5a373d97cbadce5e1fabe6095ae9957ff3aa6/main/main.cpp#L3643\n\nA loading mechanism exists but is temporarily missing due to late registration.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3616673813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]